   "date": "2026-08-05",
   "title": "８月５日、「大久保駐屯地夏まつり」で花火が上がりました！【京都府宇治市／２０２６】",
   "html": "<p>２０２６年８月５日（水）１９時２０分から、「<a href=\"https://alco-uj.com/event-uji20260708/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">大久保駐屯地夏まつり</a>」（京都宇治市広野町風呂垣外１‐１）で花火が上がりました！<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-150068\" style=\"margin: 5px;\" src=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03722.jpg\" alt=\"「大久保駐屯地夏まつり」の画像\" width=\"1030\" height=\"687\" srcset=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03722.jpg 1030w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03722-300x200.jpg 300w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03722-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03722-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1030px) 100vw, 1030px\" />（会場の近くから撮影）</p>\n<div id=\"ad-alco\" style=\"min-width: 300px; min-height: 250px;\"><script src=\"//pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js\" async=\"\"></script><!-- ALCO広告 --> <ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-8153303907959645\" data-ad-slot=\"4433263712\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins><script>\n(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script></div>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background: #FFF; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width: 540px; min-width: 326px; padding: 0; width: calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbqD9A-xx5e/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"display: block; height: 50px; margin: 0 auto 12px; width: 50px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #3897f0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 550; line-height: 18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"> </div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg);\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\"width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"> </div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"> </div>\n<div style=\"width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"> </div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 8px 0 7px; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><a style=\"color: #c9c8cd; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; line-height: 17px; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbqD9A-xx5e/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">A post shared by ALCO（アルコ）｜京都府南部のグルメ・新店・おでかけ情報 etc. (@alco_uj)</a></p>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></p>\n<p>毎年大勢の人が楽しみにしているこちらの打上花火。</p>\n<p>空は真っ暗ではなくまだ少し明るかったですが、それもまたキレイでした！</p>\n<p>夕空の色×キラキラと輝く花火との共演がカラフルで美しい！</p>\n<p>「またこんな花火が見たいな～」と心がときめきました！</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-150069\" style=\"margin: 5px;\" src=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03708.jpg\" alt=\"「大久保駐屯地夏まつり」の画像２\" width=\"1030\" height=\"687\" srcset=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03708.jpg 1030w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03708-300x200.jpg 300w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03708-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC03708-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1030px) 100vw, 1030px\" />笑顔と拍手に包まれて、感動の余韻も冷めやらぬ…</p>\n<p>そんな高揚感でいっぱいの夜。</p>\n<p>皆さんは楽しまれたでしょうか？</p>\n<p>（ちなみに明日は<a href=\"https://www.biwako-visitors.jp/hanabi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">琵琶湖の花火大会</a>です！）</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d37036.49337854534!2d135.77513049182!3d34.86641617571226!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x600110f17daa2045%3A0x5e548632e13fde6d!2z6Zm45LiK6Ieq6KGb6ZqKIOWkp-S5heS_nemnkOWxr-WcsA!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1722932418051!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": 149468,
   "url": "https://alco-uj.com/event-uji20260723/",
   "date": "2026-07-23",
   "title": "８月７日～９日、「京の七夕 in Uji」が開催予定！８月８日は、宇治橋通り商店街「スマイルサタデー クラフトビール夜市」も！【宇治市／２０２６】",
   "html": "<p>２０２６年８月７日（金）～９日（日）、「京の七夕 in Uji」（＠京都府立宇治公園・宇治川周辺）が開催予定となっています！<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-149652\" style=\"margin: 5px;\" src=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/157302a10100b678478d88f6c7c05e7d.jpg\" alt=\"「京の七夕 in Uji」の画像１\" width=\"1030\" height=\"728\" srcset=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/157302a10100b678478d88f6c7c05e7d.jpg 1030w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/157302a10100b678478d88f6c7c05e7d-300x212.jpg 300w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/157302a10100b678478d88f6c7c05e7d-1024x724.jpg 1024w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/157302a10100b678478d88f6c7c05e7d-768x543.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1030px) 100vw, 1030px\" /></p>\n<div id=\"ad-alco\" style=\"min-width: 300px; min-height: 250px;\"><script async=\"\" src=\"//pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js\"></script> <!-- ALCO広告 --> <ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display: block;\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-8153303907959645\" data-ad-slot=\"4433263712\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins> <script>\n(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script></div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-149653\" style=\"margin: 5px;\" src=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6a466acc3b2f516d8bcb4b934e89543c.jpg\" alt=\"「京の七夕 in Uji」の画像２\" width=\"1030\" height=\"728\" srcset=\"https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6a466acc3b2f516d8bcb4b934e89543c.jpg 1030w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6a466acc3b2f516d8bcb4b934e89543c-300x212.jpg 300w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6a466acc3b2f516d8bcb4b934e89543c-1024x724.jpg 1024w, https://alco-uj.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/6a466acc3b2f516d8bcb4b934e89543c-768x543.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1030px) 100vw, 1030px\" /></p>\n<p>「宇治公園ライトアップ」「願いがかなう道」「バルーン提灯」「光と笹が舞う！動くARフォトスポット」などをはじめ、ほかにもいろんな魅力でいっぱい！</p>\n<p>８月８日（土）には、宇治橋通り商店街で「スマイルサタデー クラフトビール夜市」も開催予定となっています！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"danraku2\">京の七夕 in Uji（２０２６年）　イベント概要</h2>\n<p>開催期間　２０２６年８月７日（金）～９日（日）<br />\n会場　京都府立宇治公園・宇治川周辺<br />\nHP　<a href=\"https://select-type.com/ev/?ev=EjJHSoJMhdw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://select-type.com/ev/?ev=EjJHSoJMhdw</a></p>\n"
  },
